	(text "By default we run off of the SD card, with an option to add QSPI Flash.\nIt's DNP as these chips are small and hella expensive.\nBoth sections run on 3.3V, with an option to switch to 1.8V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 178.054 167.132 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
